  "body": "thebestofwolverhampton\n  \t \nBUSINESS\nGUIDE\nA-Z\nBUSINESSES\nWHAT'S\nON\nOFFERS\nABOUT\nTHEBESTOF\nJOIN\nUS\nNEWS AND\nUPDATES\nCOMMUNITY\nGUIDE\nLOCAL\nAREAS\n\tLittle Dog Studio\t\nGo back to feature\n\n\n5/5 based on 40 reviews\n\tLatest Reviews\nIn August 2026, Roksana Cyron said:\nEverything done what ask for really about the service and the lady is really lovely would really recommend one of the best one s wouldn't go to noone else 😊\nSource: google.com\nIn August 2026, Roksana Cyron said:\nEverything done what ask for really about the service and the lady is really lovely would really recommend one of the best one s wouldn't go to noone else 😊\nSource: google.com\nIn August 2026, H Wade said:\nOur 13 week old Goldendoodle puppy went today for her first puppy groom and we couldn’t be more happy with Jo and the studio. Jo welcomed us with a warm welcome and made me and Marley feel at ease straight away. Marley came out looking and smelling beautiful and I couldn’t recommend the little dog studio enough to anyone.\nSource: google.com\nIn August 2026, H Wade said:\nOur 13 week old Goldendoodle puppy went today for her first puppy groom and we couldn’t be more happy with Jo and the studio. Jo welcomed us with a warm welcome and made me and Marley feel at ease straight away. Marley came out looking and smelling beautiful and I couldn’t recommend the little dog studio enough to anyone.\nSource: google.com\nIn August 2026, Jayne Hodgkins said:\nSo pleased with Missy’s first grooming appointment! Jo was absolutely amazing with her, and Missy came out looking and smelling beautiful. She was so calm and relaxed afterwards too, which was lovely to see. You can really tell how caring and gentle Jo is with the dogs. We’re already looking forward to her next appointment! 💕\nSource: google.com\nIn August 2026, Jayne Hodgkins said:\nSo pleased with Missy’s first grooming appointment! Jo was absolutely amazing with her, and Missy came out looking and smelling beautiful. She was so calm and relaxed afterwards too, which was lovely to see. You can really tell how caring and gentle Jo is with the dogs. We’re already looking forward to her next appointment! 💕\nSource: google.com\nIn August 2026, Sarah said:\nAbsolutely fantastic dog grooming service at Little Dog Studio! 🐾 From the moment we arrived, we felt completely at ease. Jo was so friendly, professional and gentle, and it was obvious how much she genuinely cares about the dogs in her care.\n\nThe groom was absolutely beautiful — our dog Cleo looked and smelled amazing, and we couldn’t be happier with the result! 🥰✂️🐶\n\nA lovely salon, excellent service and someone who truly takes pride in what she does. We wouldn’t hesitate to recommend her to anyone looking for a caring, professional dog groomer. 5 stars ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSource: google.com\nIn August 2026, Sarah said:\nAbsolutely fantastic dog grooming service at Little Dog Studio! 🐾 From the moment we arrived, we felt completely at ease. Jo was so friendly, professional and gentle, and it was obvious ho",
